  "description": "In a world that's been nothing but unfair to them, Yoo Jin and Yegeon have found love with each other. However, love is not without its hardships. One is plagued by addictions to gambling and alcohol, while the other has a crippling fear of abandonment, making their time together anything but boring. Others may not understand their rocky relationship, but they have their own special way of working out their issues. Things may not be perfect, but love conquers all, doesn't it?\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n *Note: Part of RIDI's Natjyeobami Danpyeonseon (낮져밤이 단편선) Collection.*",
